         stack and folds the §8.3 sync bands + sustained/burst throughput + §8.2 replay budget +
         no-rebuild-divergence into a PASS/FAIL RunArtefact (the `make load-test` entry point). -->
    <Project Path="load/Babelstone.LoadHarness.Runner/Babelstone.LoadHarness.Runner.csproj" />
